Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.33,0:00:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, this is starting to annoy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you insist on struggling when\Nthere is nothing to gain from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be obvious by\Nnow that you have lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you choose to resist\Nwhen the outcome is clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your actions are meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether we choose to die on our\Nknees or with a sword in our hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's our actions that count.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.55,0:00:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what being human's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You prefer black, like a\Nknight from the dark territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.55,0:00:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well boy if you wish to\Ncontinue suffering so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then i shall make yours\Nvery long and cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beyond anything you can\Nimagine you'll be in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such misery you'll be\Nbegging me for death!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't be enough to\Nmake up for my stupidity.
