Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.03,0:02:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The high Norkia style.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's going to try and\Nkill me with one strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.43,0:02:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.63,0:03:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, a one-handed four-hit sword skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.77,0:03:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called vertical square, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sword skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.97,0:03:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd she know that term?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe she got it from Eugeo's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.57,0:03:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll use something\NI never showed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A combo with more than four hits!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.85,0:03:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine was a six-hit skill\Ncalled Crucifixion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A one-hit skill, Sugou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nothing I do\Nnot know about the system
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.79,0:04:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which drives the properties\Nof this world. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.63,0:04:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Integrity knights aren't\Nthe only ones who lost
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their memories we did too\Nsomething very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Alice and I were born and ruled\Nand grew up together remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah I remember it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right there with you in\Nthe square when Alice was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.53,0:04:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt so helpless, but not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.97,0:04:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You charged in and stood up to that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.87,0:05:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, I'm going to help you\Nlike I should have back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, we'll save Alice. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.49,0:05:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, on your feet, you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand up as many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up, my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Him, for you, I'll stand\Nas many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you have lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you continue to resist?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.89,0:06:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's why I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.95,0:06:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you come here\Nuninvited and defy my rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.69,0:06:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offer your head to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.03,0:06:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Accept your defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.39,0:06:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.39,0:06:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not a ruler. You're a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't love this world or\Nthe people who live in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you have no right to be in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To love is to rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I love everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And rule everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.41,0:07:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.05,0:08:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.41,0:08:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.79,0:09:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, neither sword was metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.17,0:09:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not expect this outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.63,0:09:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I gathered up every spatial resource\Nhere, my wound is too great to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.01,0:09:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.71,0:09:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is much earlier than I had planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, it is time for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, the next time we meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.95,0:10:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shall be in your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.21,0:10:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your remnants!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you, Cretan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, I can become one with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're ravening!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.85,0:10:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You disgusting clown! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.03,0:10:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My administrator!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.03,0:10:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I loved all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.61,0:11:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.45,0:11:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hail, goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.94,0:11:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:12:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.73,0:12:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.57,0:12:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuju, let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'm trying to heal you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.85,0:12:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.39,0:12:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this is for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.07,0:12:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We would have fought over Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To get back the memory of the Alice I knew
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.85,0:12:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you to save Alice the Night's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then get up and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna heal you and then we'll fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're way stronger than me! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it for the old Alice's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:12:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't fight with a broken sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I was weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and gave in to Administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.21,0:13:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how I can pay for that sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't in your right mind anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fought back and snapped yourself\Nout of it like the badass you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.75,0:13:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for you, we\Ncouldn't have beat Administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you got nothing to feel guilty about!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.65,0:13:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got nothing to pay for!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish that were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always wished I could be more like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.77,0:13:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so brave, and everyone loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.69,0:13:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet Alice does, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:14:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love isn't something you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.79,0:14:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's something you give.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.49,0:14:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice taught me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see you working.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.05,0:14:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm almost done\Nmaking my part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.37,0:14:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How far did you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.81,0:14:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm way further along than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.85,0:14:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guard's all that's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's stay here and keep\Nworking until we finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But like, what if he comes looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.95,0:14:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.99,0:14:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're almost finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.67,0:14:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bit longer. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win, but we should\Nstill hurry it up. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.43,0:14:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you've been here this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.91,0:15:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's three days too early, but oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.59,0:15:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Eugeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no match for the real thing,\Nlike the one your big brother's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, this one's better than any of the\Nwooden swords the shop and town carries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.71,0:15:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never got a birthday gift\Nthat made me so, so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you crying for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.55,0:15:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.53,0:16:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us three grew up together,\Nand we're the best of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.39,0:16:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going different ways now,\Nbut our memories will live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be with you, forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.89,0:16:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't cry, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, like you said, you're not gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.89,0:16:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best of... ...friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.21,0:16:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here. I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.81,0:16:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stars sparkling in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.19,0:17:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The night sky above the Giga\NCedar was full of stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sword sparkles like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how's that for a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it the Night Sky Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.09,0:17:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.67,0:17:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ujiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're like the night sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wrapping this sorry world in your stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.51,0:17:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this is for the best, huh? It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can leave the rest to those two now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.77,0:17:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll guide the\Nworld in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:17:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:18:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.75,0:18:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
