Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick-Walka!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.05,0:19:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick-Walka! Kick-Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TIGUOKA!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Colonel, the\Ndoor's been breached.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be in the control room any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm shutting the bulkhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.34,0:19:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a couple minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to sort a few things out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higa, how long till we're locked down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need another 80...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.41,0:19:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, 70 seconds! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.63,0:19:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Keeks, it's a call\Nfrom the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.17,0:19:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.77,0:19:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kirigaya! What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.27,0:20:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in, Kirito! Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.59,0:20:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.09,0:20:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we please save the insults for later?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.39,0:20:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, I need you\Nto listen to me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.35,0:20:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.35,0:20:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get into that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, listen, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to locate a girl named Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.39,0:20:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find her and take her to - I\Ndon't have to look for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.27,0:20:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.57,0:20:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, once we're off the line,\NI'll crank the FLA to a thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then take Alice and head\Nto the world's end altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:20:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never heard of that place. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.77,0:20:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go out the eastern gate\Nand the altars due south.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.83,0:20:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.27,0:21:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two of them are heading down the corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.33,0:21:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Port electric! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.45,0:21:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just need the mains off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.25,0:21:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't damage the\Nlines for the light cube cluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.81,0:21:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you relax, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.33,0:21:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what to cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.75,0:21:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.69,0:21:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they cut the main power line\Nnow, it's gonna cause a surge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.95,0:21:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light cube cluster should be safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the subcomputer where\Nkitty guy's STL is won't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.03,0:21:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The surge will cook as Fluctlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.39,0:21:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll handle the lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.49,0:21:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higa, take Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.63,0:21:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kojiro and Asuna and\Nget to the upper shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.21,0:21:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep Kirito safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.03,0:21:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's she doing at RAF?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.35,0:21:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're cutting the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.97,0:21:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The screw propellers are going down!
